## Check the implementation

Test first/last pages, empty results, a result count that shrinks, browser Back and direct page URLs. These reference links target labelled sample sections; the production controller must load the requested records.

Use the [civica accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html) and compare the rendered result in light and dark modes, Vivid and Muted tones, and at 320 CSS pixels. The example markup is a starting point; a theme alone does not add its application logic.

## Source and related guidance

[NHS pagination](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/pagination) informs the component choice and interaction guidance. The examples use shared GOV.UK primitives or original civica markup, Arial typography and civica assets. NHS logos and service identity are not used.

